  </p>

  <h2>Digital & Sustainable Era</h2>
  <p>Today’s fashion blends global influences with tech, resale, and eco-conscious design. See an intro to
     <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sustainable_fashion">sustainable fashion</a>.</p>

  <h2>Want to Browse Primary Sources?</h2>
  <p>Visit the <a href="https://www.metmuseum.org/about-the-met/collection-areas/the-costume-institute">Met Costume Institute</a> or the
     <a href="https://www.vam.ac.uk/collections/fashion">A Fashion collection</a> for images and essays.</p>
  
